---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Rohit Ramprasad and this blog."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p class="lede">
      I'm Rohit. I write here to find out whether I actually understand things.
    </p>

    <p>
      The test I use is whether I can build a figure that makes an idea obvious.
      If I can't, I usually don't understand it yet — so most posts here are
      built around something you can drag, scrub, or otherwise interfere with.
      Topics tend to be mathematics, programming, and the occasional note about
      how I work.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/comocha">GitHub</a>, or
      subscribe via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
